# Code Conduction

## Language

Please write all documentation in English.

## Commit messages

Please build every commit message only from the ticket id and a list of completed work. Please write the whole message in English.

Please take the ticket id from the YouTrack link in the request: the path segment after `/issue/`.

`https://botticelli.youtrack.cloud/issue/SHB-1/Sample-bot` → `SHB-1`.

```
SHB-1:
- Add sample echo bot
- Store the bot certificate in SQLite
```

- Please keep the first line as `TICKET-ID:` and nothing else.
- Please follow it with a bullet list: one completed change per line.
- Please do not add a separate subject, text outside the list, or Russian text.
